+        Smoothing matrices (the histogram is `kx @ hist @ ky.T`).
+    hx : (b, nx) tensor, optional
+        Coefficients of the x-marginal term `sum_c hx[c] (sum_d dp[c,d])^2`
+    hy : (b, ny) tensor, optional
